WEBVTT

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Was that acceleration for real?</i>

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.020
<i>Was he holding back the whole time?</i>

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:57.170
<i>You've definitely got skill!</i>

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.930
<i>But you better watch out...</i>

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:06.190
<i>We'll see who's the winner next time we meet.</i>

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:19.400
<i>Professional</i>

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:19.610
<i>Aizawa, if your son really wants to do this...</i>
<i>Professional</i>

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:24.330
<i>Aizawa, if your son really wants to do this...</i>

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:27.370
<i>then I should keep my promise.</i>

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:35.120
<i>I'll never forget, the last promise I made you.</i>

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:42.990
Yeah, I know. Tonight.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:49.590
Yeah, I know. It's quite famous.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:52.110
The silver Supra.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.100
Which workshop tuned it?

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.060
Private job, I think.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.720
500hp single turbo.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.110
Pretty sure the turbo is a T87.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:06.290
I heard that it still lost to BlackBird on the loop line.
It's gonna need re-tuning.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:09.900
Really? Then we'll talk about it tonight...

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:10.660
<i>Ok.</i>

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:18.870
<i>It's BlackBird, no doubt.</i>

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:21.970
<i>But the driver is different...</i>

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.720
<i>Who was that?</i>

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.990
<i>Is there a car faster than yours, dad?</i>

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.610
<i>Of course there is.</i>

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.150
<i>It's called S30.</i>

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:47.970
<i>The S30Z has been called Devil Z since my dad was racing.</i>

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:56.050
<i>Could it be... the skill... driving that car like it has 600hp.</i>

00:03:56.050 --> 00:04:02.120
<i>In other words, he could be the
driver of the Devil Z right now.</i>

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.070
Yo!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.500
It doesn't suit you!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.610
You shouldn't drive an R.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.940
For Ohta of RGO, it has to be a rotary.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:30.350
It's really fast.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:32.880
This is the demo car from our workshop.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.840
Yeah, I know.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.920
I heard there was a big turn out at Kotabe, last week?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.840
Now, only Takagi's not here.

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.330
Oh! Takagi's here.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.720
Good evening.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.470
What about Kitami-san?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.930
He's not coming.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.670
Well, let's get going.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:56.230
We come here once a year, every year.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:00.230
I see, there's a lot of new apartments.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.950
If you want to get to this place,
you'd have to use this road.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.030
It's been 15 years...

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.630
really fast.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:28.470
I still can't believe it. You died right here at this place.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.190
At less than 50km/h...

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:35.170
A drunkard... I wish he could've just passed by.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.220
Such a shame to die on this small street.

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:44.930
I always though you'd go on the
highway, doing more than 250km/h.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.740
15 years passed by... just like that.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:51.010
Yeah, we've all become old men.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:55.590
We never thought we'd all make it this far.

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:58.790
15 years... a lot has changed.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:04.800
You wanted to go 300km/h then...
now it's not unreachable anymore.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.200
Now, it's usual to see a 500hp car during daytime too.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.720
And with air-conditioning.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.560
This is a fabulous era.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:19.480
Aizawa, the Devil Z is still running.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:26.060
You always wanted to but never had the chance.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:29.130
I thought this might be...

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:32.080
your only regret.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:39.480
Even your son has started to drive just like you.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.080
If the Devil Z is his aim...

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:46.520
Then of course we'll give him a hand.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:53.130
Yoneko-sensei, I think I want to go now.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:56.440
No way. We only come here because of you.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:59.790
You need to learn how to get "sexiness" into your acting.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.570
But it's rather late.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:04.890
I've gotta go.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.130
Hey, Reina.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:07.360
Huh?

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.530
Welcome, Yoneko-sensei.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.120
Tatsuya-kun, why are you so late?

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:17.220
I'm so sorry. I love the TV dramas you write.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.750
Really? The ratings aren't bad either.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.240
It's hard to get a taxi at this time of night.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:29.160
It's ok, I drove here.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.010
Is it tiring driving a tuned-up R?

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:38.560
Just let me walk you out.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:43.730
It's famous in the circle.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.570
And you're one of them?

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:48.500
Yeah, I drive a Supra.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.820
It's silver.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.230
The silver Supra?

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:55.450
Listen, I know it sounds weird but I have a request.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.070
For me?

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:59.580
Can you introduce me to him?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.950
The Emperor of Wangan next to Reina-san's R, the BlackBird.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:08.160
And the legendary Devil Z.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:13.430
Huh...

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:17.100
I heard you drove BlackBird.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.120
Huh?

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.230
I was slow.

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:30.120
I thought it was more tuned, just a more perfect car.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:33.620
I was wrong about BlackBird.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:38.620
I thought he's so cool all the time. Totally different from me.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:42.660
A car is a car, a driver is a driver...

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:47.500
Even at those crazy speeds, he still remains calm...

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.140
and keeps a certain distance.

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:56.140
The car is always under his control, no matter what happens.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:09:01.330
It's weird, BlackBird and Z, they just want to drive.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:04.150
But he just makes it look easy.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:07.860
I drive the same way BlackBird does.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:12.600
That injured Porsche told me all about it.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.270
What about the Supra?

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.330
What about that silver Supra you
were racing the other night?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:22.740
Is he the same or totally different?

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.870
How did you know?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.330
I happened to bump into the Supra driver.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.250
He wanted to meet you.

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.500
We'll meet one day even if we don't want to.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:38.010
If that silver Supra becomes a real machine...

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:57.940
Good morning, Kei.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:01.490
Good morning. Did you just get back, Maki?

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.910
You're the one who just got back.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.490
I've just finished work.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.540
Why don't you come to the shop?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.450
Kohta and the rest want to see you.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.790
I was busy. I drive until the morning after work.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:16.980
Then I need some sleep.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:23.480
Did you spend all your money and time on that car?

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:24.510
Maybe...

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:27.630
You're not the old Kei anymore.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:32.430
You worked at the gas station
until late at night after school.

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:38.670
After work, you, Kohta and the rest
all stayed and modified your cars.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.450
I liked watching you guys together.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:44.240
But that's already in the past.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:45.750
Yeah.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:49.220
Kei, didn't your father worked as a host too?

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:49.950
Yeah.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:56.220
Driving the same car, doing the same job,
even having the same interest in cars.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:11:00.380
I think you're even racing for your late father.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:06.200
Do you think that being the best will be enough for you?

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.760
Who knows...

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.230
That's just what I have to do.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:11.940
Hey, Kei...

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:16.500
Is it ok if I start seeing Kohta?

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:20.700
He says he likes me quite a lot.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:23.400
I know.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.670
Do you know how I feel about you?

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.370
I've always been there, by your side.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.170
I thought it'd stay that way for the rest of my life.

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.960
But I was wrong.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.900
Kei, you're getting further and further away from me.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:44.170
Kohta said he won't risk his life driving like that anymore.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.890
I hoped one day you would say that to me.

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.600
But... Kei you will not give up, just like that.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.140
You still have a chance to turn back now...

00:11:54.650 --> 00:12:02.650
There's still a big difference between when something
happens to a friend or to the most important person to you.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:07.830
Kei, you must not die.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.410
<i>Goodbye, Kei.</i>

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.430
The popular F1 turbo?

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.070
It's just a normal one but still...

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:33.830
It's an R!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.320
You can earn money if it's not an R.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.310
Try it, Yamamoto-san.

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.430
In fourth, you can bring it to 9000.

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.180
No, it's not me who's gonna drive this.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.190
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.250
I have a driver for this.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.410
Don't be surprised.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:59.740
The BlackBird has gone to Takagi.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:03.050
Is that old boy BlackBird still racing?

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:08.160
Oh yeah, BlackBird is the oldest car in the circle now.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.630
The broken Porsche will be repaired by Takagi.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:14.650
Kitami will rebuild a new engine.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:16.220
The strongest combination.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:19.350
Yeah, I'm sure it'll be amazing.

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.920
Isn't Kitami... gonna help Aizawa's son?

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:28.400
Who knows? I gave him a call...

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:31.420
You're late!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.150
I'm sorry!

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:37.650
Hey! Which club does this girl come from?

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.170
Huh?

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:44.920
Sorry! Sorry! I thought you were one of the club girls.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.120
Here he is.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.740
H-He looks exactly like his old man.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:59.100
Really?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.850
It doesn't really matter.

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:04.110
That is Aizawa, anyway.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.550
Wait a bit, Gacchan.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:10.490
You can't just go and tell him you want to tune his car.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.620
Why the hell not?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:16.610
Because we're professionals. Let him make the decision.

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:17.880
Huh?

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:20.560
That's why I asked he driver to come.

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:24.380
Eh? Me?

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:27.090
Huh? The girl is the driver?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.060
This ain't gonna work.

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:34.140
Don't worry. I think Reina-chan is the best driver for the R.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.770
Usually, he'd go to the loop line after work.

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:47.710
Try it. It's a real 800hp machine.

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:49.270
Is it really ok?

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:51.370
Reina-chan, you'll be alright.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.990
Just drive it like you always do.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.340
Is it really ok?

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:18.470
I won't take any responsibility for this.

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:22.430
He's the top ranked racer now.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.200
That's fast!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:43.130
This is for real. These guys are the best.

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:46.540
<i>Two GT-Rs?</i>

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:52.010
Not bad for a self-tuned car.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.820
That girl must've taken a lot of
effort just to catch up with him.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.510
Go to Wangan.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.010
Can she handle 800hp on the loop line?

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:03.020
I just don't think so, Gacchan.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:09.400
<i>That's right, it's the RGO demo car.</i>

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.110
<i>The 33R that raced 220 miles at Yatabe.</i>

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:17.360
<i>The demo car that Pro-Workshop spent a lot of money on.</i>

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.340
<i>But, it's power is still the focus.</i>

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.380
<i>It's a car that's hard to keep under control.</i>

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:27.370
<i>I don't care about Yatabe runway. This is the city.</i>

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:29.590
<i>Not so easy to handle!</i>

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:39.760
<i>You're not that rank.</i>

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:43.280
<i>In "Hi Boost" you produce white smoke from the exhaust.</i>

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:45.500
<i>Damaging the walls of the turbo.</i>

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:48.270
<i>Pretty soon, the front end will start to shake.</i>

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:51.770
<i>Just adding to the power, not really tuning.</i>

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:55.880
<i>You've got to tune the car in order
to withstand the extra power.</i>

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.120
<i>And strengthen lots of parts.</i>

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:01.200
<i>So the extra power doesn't damage the car.</i>

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.700
<i>Reina-san!</i>

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:07.700
<i>Do what you need to do, bit by bit.</i>

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:09.720
<i>Tuning is not magic.</i>

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.880
The girl's gone past him!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:17.210
I knew Reina-chan could do it.

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.860
Gacchan, let's go!

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:28.820
Wow, did you tune this R too?!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.310
Oh, yeah!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:33.820
Liar! You said you'd stop "hard-tuning" cars!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.320
Only this R is special.

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:40.330
<i>No way... even this!</i>

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:46.400
<i>His engine is starting to wear out.</i>

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:48.830
<i>He can't get it to go any faster.</i>

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.710
<i>He keeps lying to himself and tries to keep it racing...</i>

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:55.830
<i>The only reason he ever won was
because he never met a real tuned car.</i>

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:58.670
<i>No way...</i>

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.410
<i>It can't be... I can't catch them.</i>

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:07.350
<i>They are the real, professionally tuned race cars.</i>

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.930
You're good, missy!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:21.390
Nice to finally meet you.

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:23.610
We've met before when you were just a young boy.

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:29.150
You worked with my old man, right?

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:29.870
Yeah.

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:31.920
I was his number one

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:33.030
best friend, Sasaki G-

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.620
Can you tune my car?

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.990
That's pretty forward!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.330
Can I...

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.590
How could you ask a favor of someone so easily?

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:45.820
We only raced for less than the loop line.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.910
Do you really understand...

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.900
the tuned cars we made?

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:54.100
I never trusted the "so-called" professional tuners.

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:58.910
I used to race with cars tuned using hardly any money.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.150
But they were just as fast.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:03.320
It's a business full of cheaters.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:07.110
Hey, hey, wait a minute.
I admit that there are workshops like that...

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:10.850
But, today I changed my opinion.

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:15.130
Not just the speed, but you have a
different level of accomplishment.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:19.380
I felt like this was the first time I'd seen a real tuned car.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:22.560
Well, not really the first time...

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:24.880
I saw BlackBird too...

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:30.090
So, you understand it then... anyway.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:34.350
Please, make me a real tuned car.

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.470
I know my father trusted you.

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:56.840
Ah, you're here.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:58.600
Good evening.

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:02.690
Is this the BlackBird's engine?

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:05.840
Yeah. The basics are all done.

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:07.840
Just need to install it now.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.390
Wanna know how powerful it is?

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:11.260
Yeah.

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:13.480
This time it's 800hp.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.570
I wanted to say so...

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:17.810
the power is barely enhanced.

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:19.530
I've just broke it down and put it together again.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.490
I wanted to modify some of the parts...

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:25.270
but I changed my mind when
I saw the inside of the engine.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:28.280
It's really quite clean in there.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.870
Did you drive it before?

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.110
Yeah, with Takagi-san.

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:34.790
The body can't take it anymore.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:38.160
I felt it was seriously losing it's power.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:40.290
I didn't realize it was such a hard car to drive.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:44.000
Yeah, it was wasting as least 100bhp at the wheels.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:48.220
At 600hp, the power was just damaging BlackBird.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.860
That's unfortunately the destiny of a tuned car.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:56.520
The body is expected to carry twice the
power and so wears down twice as quick.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:59.390
The bottleneck of a tuned car is the body.

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:01.650
Now you can appreciate how "great" Takagi is.

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:06.840
RB...

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.660
It's a pretty high-standard modification.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.280
<i>Akio-kun's here too.</i>

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.310
Good evening.

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:18.030
What's with the car?

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:20.860
Borrowed it. It's the RGO demo car.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:22.000
RGO?

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:23.590
Yeah, I see.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.540
It's the demo car at Ohta's place.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:27.520
Is it fast?

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:29.150
Yeah, really fast!

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:30.880
Three times faster than my R!

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:35.640
Well, let's get the two of them racing for a bit.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:35.990
Eh?

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:36.650
Eh?
Eh?

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:50.620
How long have you been standing there?

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.300
About 30 minutes.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.360
The engine's with Kitami-san?

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:57.920
Yeah, all broken down.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:02.320
In fact, we have to work on another car too.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:05.300
I don't think this can be done perfectly.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:09.710
80%, but I'll make sure you're completely satisfied with it.

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:13.930
What is the next car going to be?

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.470
A silver 80 Supra.

00:22:16.470 --> 00:22:19.300
And I can't leave it alone.

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:22.190
Pretty soon you'll meet the guy.

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:23.690
That Supra?

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:27.690
It might even be able to beat the Devil Z.

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:29.130
I see.

00:22:30.720 --> 00:22:32.910
But, I'm going to beat that Supra.

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:34.140
Oh?

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:35.730
And after that, the Z.

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:38.000
I'll prove it to you.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:40.580
No one can race better than BlackBird.

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:55.970
Wow, this is surprising.

00:22:55.970 --> 00:23:00.970
Since when did that lady become such a good R driver?

00:23:00.970 --> 00:23:03.390
She has a lot more power than me.

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:08.990
She's using that 800hp... very seriously.
